  m_text: '<b>Disease<pos=33%>Treatment<pos=70%>Dose<pos=86%>Every</b>

    Early
    blight (tomato)<pos=33%>Mancozeb 75 WP<pos=70%>2.5 g/L<pos=86%>7 days

    Late
    blight (potato)<pos=33%>Copper oxychloride 50 WP<pos=70%>3 g/L<pos=86%>10 days

    Bacterial
    spot (pepper)<pos=33%>Streptocycline + copper<pos=70%>0.1 g/L<pos=86%>10 days

    Powdery
    mildew (squash)<pos=33%>Wettable sulphur 80 WP<pos=70%>2 g/L<pos=86%>10 days

    Leaf
    curl virus (chilli)<pos=33%>Neem oil (vector control)<pos=70%>5 mL/L<pos=86%>7
    days

    <color=#B3241F>Always: PPE on - 24 h re-entry - log every spray</color>'
